stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> QUESTION
    QUESTION --> INTAKE_FAIL: not atomic/falsifiable/scoped/time-bounded
    INTAKE_FAIL --> STOP
    QUESTION --> MATCH: intake pass
    MATCH --> NONE
    MATCH --> PARTIAL
    MATCH --> EXACT
    MATCH --> ISOMORPHIC
    ISOMORPHIC --> PARTIAL: equivalence fails
    ISOMORPHIC --> STOP_POINT: equivalence passes
    EXACT --> STOP_POINT
    PARTIAL --> MISSING_EVIDENCE
    NONE --> STOP
    STOP_POINT --> CITE_STOP: sufficient + fresh
    STOP_POINT --> MISSING_EVIDENCE: insufficient / stale / applicability gap
    MISSING_EVIDENCE --> QUOTE
    QUOTE --> STOP: not authorized
    QUOTE --> PAID_CYCLE: human authorized
    PAID_CYCLE --> RESULT
    RESULT --> PRIVATE
    RESULT --> MIXED
    RESULT --> PUBLIC_ELIGIBLE
    PUBLIC_ELIGIBLE --> PUBLIC_REVIEW
    PUBLIC_REVIEW --> VERSIONED_PUBLIC_STATE: approved
    PUBLIC_REVIEW --> PRIVATE: rejected/deferred
    VERSIONED_PUBLIC_STATE --> [*]
    PRIVATE --> [*]
    MIXED --> PUBLIC_REVIEW: public extract eligible
